--- OLD
NewGamePartyGeneration:
    LDA #$00                ; turn off the PPU
    STA $2001
--- NEW
.import opt_freestuff
.export NewGamePartyUI

NewGamePartyGeneration:
    ;  New Game's world, after its party.  The party is made already: New
    ;  Game's flow (newgame.asm's ng_flow) runs party creation, below, as its
    ;  last screen, so the prologue's music plays on through it and its B on
    ;  the first character goes back a screen (menus.txt).  Then this, from
    ;  GameStart: the world, the roll screen up meanwhile, and whatever the
    ;  Treasures flags say a new game starts with.  Here rather than beside
    ;  the call in the fixed bank, which has three bytes left -- and it makes
    ;  no difference, because nothing between this and the map touches the
    ;  first page of unsram.
    JSL opt_freestuff + OPTFAR
NewGamePartyBack:
    RTS

;;  Party creation, from New Game's flow through OptCallFar.  Out: C clear,
;;  the party recorded -- the last @RecordClassAndName, X = $30, leaves it
;;  clear, its two ASLs shifting out zeros; C set, B on the first character.
NewGamePartyUI:
    LDA #$00                ; turn off the PPU
    STA $2001
